403 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 65 0 R /Rect [ 56.723999 564.642001 283.463013 745.791003 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure5) /TU (Bar graph comparing the proportion correct for "Non-learners" and "Learners" across three video types: Nonsegmented Training, Familiar Segmented, and Novel Segmented. "Learners show a decrement in performance from Nonsegmented Training videos to Familiar Segmented and Novel Segmented videos. Non-learners show an improvement in performance from Nonsegmented Training videos to Novel Segmented videos. Error bars indicate within-subject variability.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
404 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 65 0 R /Rect [ 311.666992 520.640963 538.453979 745.622958 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure6) /TU (Line graph showing pigeons proportion correct over six 700-trial blocks for normal and abnormal categories. Normal category \(solid line\) displays an upward trend, beginning around 0.55 and reaching 0.75. Abnormal category \(dotted line\) starts at 0.50, also trending upward to approximately 0.70. Error bars indicate variability.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
